msgid "已套用單次重啟防護參數並發送重啟信號，系統正在重啟..."
msgstr "One-time reboot guard applied and reboot signal sent. Restarting..."

msgid "已成功設定 {}，系統正在重新啟動..."
msgstr "Successfully configured {}, restarting system..."

msgid "已成功設定重啟並直通進入 WinRE 修復環境"
msgstr "Successfully configured reboot directly into WinRE recovery environment"

msgid "已發送 Win32 原生重啟信號，系統正在重啟..."
msgstr "Sent native Win32 reboot signal. Restarting..."

msgid "已連接隨身碟，但未偵測到包含 PE 環境"
msgstr "USB drive connected, but no PE environment detected"

msgid "成功建立 PE 啟動項！因 {}，為避免黑屏系統即將關機。請於電腦斷電後按電源鍵開機即可亮屏進入 PE！"
msgstr "PE entry created! Due to {}, shutting down to prevent black screen. Power on manually to boot PE!"

msgid "找不到 ESP / 開機分區"
msgstr "ESP / boot partition not found"

msgid "找不到目標系統的 SYSTEM 登錄檔: {}"
msgstr "Cannot find SYSTEM registry hive for target system: {}"

msgid "找不到開機設定存放區 (BCD): {}"
msgstr "Boot configuration data (BCD) not found: {}"

msgid "未在開機選單中註冊 (BCD 無對應項目)"
msgstr "Unregistered in boot menu (no matching BCD entry)"

msgid "未配置 WinRE 修復環境"
msgstr "WinRE recovery environment not configured"

msgid "未配置開機引導或檔案缺失"
msgstr "Missing bootloader or system files"

msgid "本地 PE 啟動項 ({}) 含有無效分區指向 (unknown)，開機會引發藍屏 (0xc000000e)！已自動阻斷重啟。請重新於系統內安裝本地 PE 或改用 USB 隨身碟啟動。"
msgstr "Local PE boot entry ({}) points to unknown partition, causing BSOD 0xc000000e! Reboot blocked. Reinstall local PE or use a bootable USB drive."

msgid "此操作將立即重新啟動電腦並自動進入 UEFI BIOS 設定畫面。"
msgstr "Restarts the computer immediately and enters UEFI BIOS setup automatically."

msgid ""
"此操作將透過 BCD 開啟 Hypervisor 開機載入 (hypervisorlaunchtype auto)。若勾選核心隔離，將一併開啟 VBS 與記憶體完整性。\n"
"\n"
"提示：需在 BIOS 開啟 CPU 虛擬化 (VT-x / SVM)。需要重新開機才會生效。確定要執行並重啟嗎？"
msgstr ""
"This will enable Hypervisor boot loading via BCD (hypervisorlaunchtype auto). If Core Isolation is checked, VBS and Memory Integrity will also be turned on.\n"
"\n"
"Note: CPU Virtualization (VT-x / SVM) must be enabled in BIOS. Proceed and restart now?"

msgid ""
"此操作將透過 BCD 關閉 Hypervisor 開機載入 (hypervisorlaunchtype off)。若勾選核心隔離，將一併關閉 VBS 與記憶體完整性。\n"
"\n"
"需要重新開機才會生效。確定要執行並重啟嗎？"
msgstr ""
"This will disable Hypervisor boot loading via BCD (hypervisorlaunchtype off). If Core Isolation is checked, VBS and Memory Integrity will also be turned off.\n"
"\n"
"A reboot is required. Proceed and restart now?"

msgid "無法判定系統所在的實體磁碟"
msgstr "Unable to determine physical disk for system"

msgid "無法執行 bcdedit: {}"
msgstr "Failed to execute bcdedit: {}"

msgid "無法存取開機分區 ({})"
msgstr "Cannot access boot partition ({})"

msgid "無法掛載目標系統的 SYSTEM 登錄檔 Hive"
msgstr "Failed to mount target system SYSTEM registry Hive"

msgid "無法載入實體系統的 SOFTWARE 登錄檔 Hive"
msgstr "Failed to load physical system SOFTWARE registry Hive"

msgid "目標系統 {}: 無法開機（{}），已中止重啟配置！"
msgstr "Target system {}: Unbootable ({}), aborted reboot configuration!"

msgid ""
"目標系統 {}: 無法開機（原因：{}）。\n"
"\n"
"為確保電腦安全，系統已阻斷重啟引導設定！請檢查該系統分區之 EFI 開機引導與核心檔案是否健全。"
msgstr ""
"Target system {}: Unbootable (Reason: {}).\n"
"\n"
"To protect your PC, reboot configuration was blocked! Please verify EFI bootloader and kernel files."

msgid "目標系統無法開機"
msgstr "Target system unbootable"

msgid "系統碟 ({}:) 介面為 IDE/ATA，儲存驅動狀態正常 (Start=0)"
msgstr "System disk ({}:) is IDE/ATA, storage driver status normal (Start=0)"

msgid "系統碟 ({}:) 介面為 NVMe，stornvme 開機驅動狀態正常 (Start=0)"
msgstr "System disk ({}:) is NVMe, stornvme boot driver status normal (Start=0)"

msgid "系統碟 ({}:) 介面為 RAID/VMD，儲存驅動狀態正常 (Start=0)"
msgstr "System disk ({}:) is RAID/VMD, storage driver status normal (Start=0)"

msgid "系統碟 ({}:) 介面為 SATA/AHCI，儲存驅動狀態正常 (Start=0)"
msgstr "System disk ({}:) is SATA/AHCI, storage driver status normal (Start=0)"

msgid "缺少 ntoskrnl 核心檔案"
msgstr "Missing ntoskrnl kernel file"

msgid "缺少 winload 核心載入器"
msgstr "Missing winload kernel loader"

msgid "缺少韌體開機管理程式 (bootmgfw.efi/bootmgr)"
msgstr "Missing firmware boot manager (bootmgfw.efi/bootmgr)"

msgid "讀取 BCD 本地項目失敗: {}"
msgstr "Failed to read local BCD entries: {}"

